WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.229
Integers include positive and negative numbers. On the number line right adds and

00:00:05.229 --> 00:00:06.003
left subtracts.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:12.192
Calculate 10 plus (3). The answer is 13. On the number line, start at 10 and move

00:00:12.192 --> 00:00:12.819
plus 3.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:19.503
The thermometer at a farm reads -14 degrees C and changes by plus 12 degrees C. What

00:00:19.503 --> 00:00:22.575
does it read afterward? Pause the video and think.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:29.424
The thermometer at a farm reads -14 degrees C and changes by plus 12 degrees C. What

00:00:29.424 --> 00:00:35.398
does it read afterward? The answer is -2. On the number line, start at -14 and move

00:00:35.398 --> 00:00:36.101
plus 12.
